    c_spacex_q3_2026_q1_2027_guide_low_vs_cons: {"v":10800,"unit":"USD millions","display":"+$10.8B","label":"Q1 2027 revenue guidance (low end, $33B) against LSEG consensus","tier":"C","src":"bw","asOf":"2026-09-30","on":"2026-10-27","hatched":true,"note":"33000 - 22200 = 10800. Q1 2027 revenue guide (low end, $33B) vs LSEG: ABOVE. Guidance is a range, $33-37B; even the low end clears the LSEG average by about half."},
